      "en": "Paul, as was his custom, went in to them; and for three Sabbath days reasoned with them from the Scriptures,",
      "ko": "바울이 자기의 규례대로 저희에게로 들어가서 세 안식일에 성경을 가지고 강론하며",
      "source_text_hash": "6c5f566b0f5fbc0bfacb506746df3744bde2ab05c89ccac2be8d70b7f8e9ba61",
      "translation_text_hash": "41dacb24072e0c8cdec05586061d70ad4aea86906512a6119b17bd0971daa1e5",
