      "en": "Some of them were persuaded and joined Paul and Silas: of the devout Greeks a great multitude, and not a few of the chief women.",
      "ko": "그 중에 어떤 사람 곧 경건한 헬라인의 큰 무리와 적지 않은 귀부인도 권함을 받고 바울과 실라를 좇으나",
      "source_text_hash": "12033e64a0447718937263bcb652414810533cfff0c392d40f276b4874a73845",
      "translation_text_hash": "d64bd2d3c16f1fa650704aac62572ae3e4d5b176ba258ca01100b403e49147f1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
