      "en": "The multitude and the rulers of the city were troubled when they heard these things.",
      "ko": "무리와 읍장들이 이 말을 듣고 소동하여",
      "source_text_hash": "54aea2ffbf55a791102f1f77fed32611a279b3406855b40f4a5d0cad6323892c",
      "translation_text_hash": "b852278e386b282890846bb2bc10688321bd88de77f09e1096d68fd18271cc82",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
