      "en": "When they had taken security from Jason and the rest, they let them go.",
      "ko": "야손과 그 나머지 사람들에게 보를 받고 놓으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6895425e718918cc99d46dada9fd88235cfdf2cfa8a12eed5b6f9e88b5143d66",
      "translation_text_hash": "07d0d1ce1c14b7f902339cb86bce1f7cb215e1b1950d57b869ebc11290d67b8f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
